hero_accent: ask first
hero_subtext: Plain answers about who the house is for, how to give, how to refer a woman, and how to help. We are pre-house, and the answers say so.
hero_note: a safe, supportive home
hero_image: /assets/images/photos/room-morning-day.webp
hero_w: 1536
